.claude/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
.env
**/.env

# card-news exported PNGs + captions — regenerable from runs*/.dc.html + assets
# via tools/export_cardnews.mjs, and already saved locally on PC. Keeping them
# out of git keeps repo growth manageable (each day's batch adds ~150MB).
cardnews-template/output/
cardnews-template/output-owlsight/

# review pages embed all slide PNGs as base64 (heavier than the PNGs
# themselves) and are already published as Artifacts + regenerable via
# tools/build_review_page.mjs / build_hub_page.mjs. Keep manifest-*.json
# (small, useful URL index) but drop the generated HTML.
cardnews-template/review/*.html
cardnews-template/review-owlsight/*.html

# daily card-news working folders (script.md, filled .dc.html, sourced
# photos) — synced separately via Naver MyBox instead of git, so git stays
# scoped to just the reusable pipeline (tools/templates/pipeline).
cardnews-template/runs/
cardnews-template/runs-owlsight/
